      "message": "This is not going to work once we enable python3. This %py2_install should be in the %install section, and if python3 is enabled this is in the %files python3-virtualbmc section.\n\nSo the structure should be:\n\n%install\n%if 0%{?with_python3}\n...all python3 stuff\n%endif\n%py2_install\n\n# Setup directories\ninstall -d -m ......\n\n%if 0%{?with_python3}\n%files python3-%{sname}\n.....\n%endif\n\n%files python2-%{sname}\n...",
